Oh, hot damn!=A0 I haven't seen a myopic singular in a while. -- nor an exp=
lanation or justification in even longer.=A0 It would be strange for a myop=
ic singular (in the & sense) to do anything, including exist or even be.=A0=
 But there is nothing odd about {lo tadni cu sruri lo dinja}, from which I =
would infer-- did I not know it already -- that the expression doesn't refe=
r to such things (whatever they may be said to be), but just to ordinary ta=
dni=A0 and dinja going about their ordinary business in ordinary ways.

